## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Companion Affinity|r 0.5.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Shows on the HUD when each way of raising your companion's rapport can be used again. The game gives no cooldown to read, so every rapport gain is noticed, traced to what you had just done, and timed.
